@EndUserText.label: 'Travel Access Control'
@MappingRole: true
define role ZC_ZTRAVEL_AUTH {
  grant select on ZR_ZTRAVEL
    where AgencyID = $session.user;
}

"IMPORTANT:
"This is an illustrative condition only. It assumes AgencyID can be compared
"to the current user, which is usually NOT a valid business authorization
"mapping. Replace it with your project's user-to-agency mapping, PFCG role,
"authorization object, or another supported DCL condition.
